    "title": "Another Wilmington resident lands spot on 'Wheel of Fortune' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kaitlyn Aguiles ,\n5 hours ago WILMINGTON, N.C. (WECT) - A Wilmington resident will appear on the game show ‘Wheel of Fortune’ on Thursday night. Sharon Stukes is scheduled to compete on the long-running program, which airs May 21 at 7 p.m. on WECT. Stukes is the latest Wilmington-area contestant to be featured on... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
